{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the vibrant streets of India and become the go-to roadside mechanic. In Indian Mechanic Simulator, you\u2019ll fix punctures, repair engines, wash, paint, and restore everything from scooters to family cars. Every job brings new challenges, from simple tyre changes to full restorations.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extras/741925ae6835385b02edce6cff77645e.webp?t=1772791080\" width=650 height=63 /></span><br><br>From rusty scooters to modern cars, each vehicle demands unique tools, timing, and skill to fix perfectly.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extras/de8971ab79d7e5a770e3466e52fd7d91.poster.avif?t=1772791080\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extras/de8971ab79d7e5a770e3466e52fd7d91.webm?t=1772791080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extras/de8971ab79d7e5a770e3466e52fd7d91.mp4?t=1772791080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extras/9874cc30a43cd26d455e26ddb687068b.webp?t=1772791080\" width=650 height=63 /></span><br><br>Scrub every inch, rinse the mess, and make old, dusty vehicles look brand new again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extras/a9d32ce23c0c538905b845c2dbe72d52.poster.avif?t=1772791080\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691110/extr